12. PRIVACY

    The Software runs entirely on Your computer and keeps Your data there. Your
    Path of Exile session is stored on Your machine, encrypted at rest using
    Your operating system's secure store where one is available; the Software
    warns You if it is not. Your session is never transmitted to the Author.

    The Software communicates with the Path of Exile trade API on Your behalf.
    A packaged build additionally asks the GitHub releases API whether a newer
    version exists; that request carries no account, machine or usage data. The
    Author operates no server and collects no telemetry, analytics or personal
    data.


